# A game folder Steam doesn't list although it's connected (Oct 23: Michael reinstalled Portalistic on the
# M1 without deleting the games; Steam's first start, which installs Steam, comes before bottle-libraries
# can add the folder, so the games weren't there). With Steam up a minute and no game running: Steam
# restarts once (bottle-libraries sync runs in between, and the games in the folder's steamapps are
# back), with a banner. At most once an hour per folder; BOTTLE_LIBGUARD=0 turns it off.
# -> 0 when Steam was restarted, 1 otherwise.
libs_guard() {  # $1 = what Steam does, $2 = the VM's lines (see playmap_cmd)
